Doodle Icons notice

Original icon design: Khushmeen Sidhu
Source: https://khushmeen.com/icons.html
Distribution reference: react-doodle-icons v1.0.0 by Mike Acler
Package source: https://github.com/agilek/react-doodle-icons
Package license: MIT, as declared by the package metadata

The original Doodle Icons distribution allows personal and commercial use
without attribution. This project vendors selected SVG paths, adapts their
colors and sizing, and adds matching project-specific glyphs where the source
set does not include the required business icon.
